should return `[]`\n- Start == End (same node)\n- `findPath` — neighbor already in open list with better g-score (`openList.updateItem` branch at AStarFinder.js:116)\n\n## Priority 3 — src/finders/DijkstraFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Verify heuristic override to `0` — all neighbors explored uniformly\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- Constructor option passthrough\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GHFkE2eCD7Pa9P7vunDQ2c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W6LZaw3cJzGmupcQCgH7qb","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-01-test-blitz/workers/test-writer-3/input/assignments.md","content":"# Test Writer 3 — BestFirst + BreadthFirst + All Bi-directional Finders\n\n## Scope\nBestFirstFinder, BreadthFirstFinder, and all four bi-directional finders (BiAStar, BiBreadthFirst, BiDijkstra, BiBestFirst).\n\n---\n\n## Priority 1 — src/finders/BiAStarFinder.js (HIGH)\n\n- All constructor options (same gaps as AStarFinder: allowDiagonal, dontCrossCorners, diagonalMovement, weight, heuristic)\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- `biBacktrace(node, neighbor)` meeting-point path join — start-side expansion finds end-side node\n- `biBacktrace(neighbor, node)` reverse direction join — end-side expansion finds start-side node\n- Both expansion directions meeting explicitly asserted\n\n## Priority 2 — src/finders/BestFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Custom heuristic injection\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- Constructor option coverage (same as AStarFinder)\n- The `* 1000000` scaling effect: on open grid, path should be greedy (go straight toward goal)\n\n## Priority 3 — src/finders/BreadthFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Diagonal movement enabled variants\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- Start == End\n- Constructor `allowDiagonal` / `dontCrossCorners` / `diagonalMovement` options\n\n## Priority 4 — src/finders/BiBreadthFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Diagonal movement variants\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- `biBacktrace` call from end-side expansion (BiBreadthFirstFinder.js:100)\n- Start == End\n\n## Priority 5 — src/finders/BiDijkstraFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Same gaps as BiAStarFinder + DijkstraFinder combined\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- Verify uniform cost behavior\n\n## Priority 6 — src/finders/BiBestFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Same gaps as BestFirstFinder + bi-directional meeting logic\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8080,"cache_read_input_tokens":14035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8080},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"72a8c5be-b7cd-4258-8cfe-39ab16c21233","uuid":"1c165e02-8735-4b16-b1ab-f87fbf474781"}
