eadthFirstFinder.js:100)\n- Start == End\n\n## Priority 5 — src/finders/BiDijkstraFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Same gaps as BiAStarFinder + DijkstraFinder combined\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- Verify uniform cost behavior\n\n## Priority 6 — src/finders/BiBestFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- Same gaps as BestFirstFinder + bi-directional meeting logic\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GHFkE2eCD7Pa9P7vunDQ2c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HsCsjkeAjKVawxxcXfQyxh","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-01-test-blitz/workers/test-writer-4/input/assignments.md","content":"# Test Writer 4 — IDAStarFinder + All JumpPoint Finders\n\n## Scope\nIDAStarFinder and the entire JumpPoint family: factory, base, and all 4 diagonal-movement variants.\n\n---\n\n## Priority 1 — src/finders/JPFAlwaysMoveDiagonally.js (HIGH — entire file untested)\n\n- `_jump` — diagonal forced-neighbor detection (line 43-51)\n- `_jump` — horizontal forced neighbors (line 56-59)\n- `_jump` — vertical forced neighbors (line 61-64)\n- `_jump` — end-node detection, out-of-bounds/unwalkable returns null\n- `_findNeighbors` — diagonal, horizontal, vertical parent directions + no parent\n- End-to-end `findPath` on maze\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n\n## Priority 2 — src/finders/JPFMoveDiagonallyIfNoObstacles.js (HIGH — entire file untested)\n\n- `_jump` — diagonal sub-jump calls (line 49)\n- `_jump` — horizontal forced neighbors (line 56-59)\n- `_jump` — vertical forced neighbors (line 62-65)\n- `_jump` — diagonal continuation gating (`isWalkableAt(x+dx,y) && isWalkableAt(x,y+dy)`) at line 75\n- `_findNeighbors` — all parent-direction branches\n- End-to-end `findPath` on maze\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n\n## Priority 3 — src/finders/IDAStarFinder.js (HIGH)\n\n- `timeLimit` option — path not found due to time expiry → `[]` (IDAStarFinder.js:105-108)\n- `trackRecursion: true` — `retainCount` and `tested` tracking branches (IDAStarFinder.js:137-144)\n- `weight` != 1\n- Custom heuristic\n- Diagonal movement variants\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n- The `route` array construction (IDAStarFinder.js:118-121)\n\n## Priority 4 — src/finders/JumpPointFinder.js factory (HIGH)\n\n- `DiagonalMovement.Always` → `JPFAlwaysMoveDiagonally` — verify correct class selected\n- `DiagonalMovement.OnlyWhenNoObstacles` → `JPFMoveDiagonallyIfNoObstacles` — verify correct class\n- Default (no option) → falls through to `JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle`\n\n## Priority 5 — src/finders/JPFNeverMoveDiagonally.js (HIGH)\n\n- `_jump` — horizontal forced-neighbor detection (line 42-45)\n- `_jump` — vertical + recursive horizontal sub-jumps (line 53)\n- `_jump` — `throw new Error(\"Only horizontal and vertical movements are allowed\")` (line 58)\n- `_jump` — `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n- `_findNeighbors` — horizontal, vertical, no parent\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n\n## Priority 6 — src/finders/JPFMoveDiagonallyIfAtMostOneObstacle.js (HIGH)\n\n- `_jump` — diagonal forced-neighbor detection (line 43-47)\n- `_jump` — diagonal continuation gating null-return when both blocked (line 71)\n- `_jump` — `trackJumpRecursion: true`\n- `_findNeighbors` — diagonal parent forced-neighbor additions (lines 110-115)\n- `_findNeighbors` — horizontal parent forced-obstacle-adjacent diagonal neighbors\n- `_findNeighbors` — no parent\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\n\n## Priority 7 — src/finders/JumpPointFinderBase.js (MEDIUM)\n\n- `_identifySuccessors` — `jumpNode.closed` skip branch (line 89)\n- `_identifySuccessors` — `openList.updateItem` branch (ng < jumpNode.g, line 107)\n- `trackJumpRecursion: true` option\n- No-path scenario (open list exhausted) → `[]`\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8080,"cache_read_input_tokens":14035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8080},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"72a8c5be-b7cd-4258-8cfe-39ab16c21233","uuid":"72a7a939-ab48-4df6-a801-c25908c2956a"}
